@bgm Bgm_7_1

# Judge10-13-1

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@pauseTrial false

@hideStageScreen 1

@char Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate 魔女だとか魔法とか……<br>もういいって！

@char Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate あてぃし帰るから！<br>こんなとこ<br>いられないっての！

@char CreatureHiro.5
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate そもそも<br>出る手段もないと思うが……。

@char Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "んなわけないっての！<br>絶対<link=\"Objection_02_05_13_01\">なんかある</link>に<br>決まってるし！"

@char Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate あてぃしは<br>帰らなきゃダメなの！<br>お前らなんかと<br>遊んでる暇ないんだよ！

@char Coco.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate ドッキリかなんか<br>知らないけどふざけんなよ！

@char Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "マジお前らキモいから！<br>こっち<link=\"Objection_02_05_13_02\">見る</link>んじゃねー！！"

# ＠備考◆泣きそう

@char Coco.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
